        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Comments</head>
                <p xml:id="CH1a0907-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_007-27a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2022-03-19T20:32:44.529+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-71a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#Valerie.Kiel" modified="2022-12-08T23:31:37.853+09:00">死 in all the parallel lines: possibly to be read as nominal? (As in 饑渴(之)死; relation = TYPE?) (VK)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-38a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#Valerie.Kiel" modified="2023-01-08T03:55:26.86+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-36a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#Valerie.Kiel" modified="2023-01-08T03:55:45.58+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-74a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#Valerie.Kiel" modified="2023-02-16T06:00:58.717+09:00">and &gt; while? (VK)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-77a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2023-03-30T02:53:25.447+09:00">is selective on whom to choose, DISCUSS NEXT WEEK IN COMPARISON TO GUANZI!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_016-77a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2023-03-30T03:01:00.262+09:00">but not selective on whom to give to&gt;reward (i.e. will make gifts to or reward anyone, without selecting the right person to give to or reward)) One might think that the gentleman will be highly selective on whom to reward: namely those who merit reward, and not those who do not merit reward...</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_001-15a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#chris" modified="2024-06-20T17:50:00.964+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Chénggōng Gān said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">"Your resources are few,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">while Qū Chūn's resources are many.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Yú Yì has obtained the world's greatest sorrows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">yet you take him as a friend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Míng Hè and Chú Gǒu have very little wisdom,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">yet you amuse yourself with them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Chīyí Zǐpí attends to Qū Chūn daily,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">and Sǔn Pō is his friend.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.18" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">The wisdom of these two men</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.19" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">is sufficient to be Prime Minister (Lìngyǐn),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.20" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">yet they dare not use their wisdom for themselves, but entrust it to Qū Chūn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.21" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Therefore, it is said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-6a.22" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">'Will not political power ultimately fall to Qū Chūn?'"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">2.7 Tián Zǐfāng crossed the West River (Xīhé)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">and went to visit Zhái Huáng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Zhái Huáng was riding in a high carriage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">covered by an ornate canopy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">with golden reins,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">the fine bamboo mat held down with weights.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Like this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">he had eighty four-horse carriages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Zǐfāng saw this from a distance</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">and suspected it was a sovereign lord.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">The road was narrow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">so he got down, moved his carriage aside, and waited for him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">When Zhái Huáng arrived and saw that it was Zǐfāng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.15" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">he got down from his carriage and hurried forward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.16" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">placing himself downwind as a sign of respect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.17" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.18" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">"My apologies."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.19" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">Tián Zǐfāng said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH1a0907_CHANT_002-7a.20" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#KrischanReese" modified="2025-11-18T19:08:28.762+09:00">"It's you!"</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
